@baseUrl = http://localhost:9080/api/jaxrs
@authUrl = http://localhost:8089

### Authorization Code Flow with PKCE: step 3: Authorization Code Request.

# @no-redirect
< {%
	client.global.set("verifier", "qNfsHppOAjxzkPN5kvDEN1UyRiT5a1vR35Hc7L8de_4");
	client.global.set("challenge", "XLBAu9VL9nN9XA8lUH2feqDrZ6PsliWdb7Y-tcdJjjU");
%}

GET {{authUrl}}/oauth2/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=authorization-pkce-client&redirect_uri=http://localhost/cli&state=44b282f8-dd72-4b58-bf1e-06c86fc940b6&scope=read-write&code_challenge={{challenge}}&code_challenge_method=S256
Accept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml

### Authorization Code Flow with PKCE: step 4: Redirect to login/authorization prompt.

GET {{authUrl}}/login
Accept: text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml

> {%
	let body;
	if (typeof response.body === 'string') {
		body = response.body;
	} else if (response.body && response.body.toString() !== '[object Object]') {
		body = response.body.toString();
	} else {
		body = JSON.stringify(response.body);
	}

	let regex = /<input\s+name="_csrf"\s+type="hidden"\s+value="([^"]+)"\s*\/?>/i;
	let match = regex.exec(body);
	if (match) {
		client.global.set("csrf", match[1]);
	} else {
		throw `Nie znaleziono _csrf! Status: ${response.status}, typ body: ${typeof response.body}, treść: ${String(body).substring(0, 300)}`;
	}
%}

### Authorization Code Flow with PKCE: step 5: Authenticate and Consent.

# @no-redirect
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=kevin&password=useruser&_csrf={{csrf}}

### Authorization Code Flow with PKCE: step 6: Authorization Code.

# @no-redirect
GET {{authUrl}}/oauth2/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=authorization-pkce-client&redirect_uri=http://localhost/cli&state=44b282f8-dd72-4b58-bf1e-06c86fc940b6&scope=read-write&code_challenge={{challenge}}&code_challenge_method=S256&continue

> {%
	let location = response.headers.valueOf("Location");
	const codeIndex = location.indexOf('code=');
	if (codeIndex !== -1) {
		let code = location.substring(codeIndex + 5);
		const nextParamIndex = code.indexOf('&');
		if (nextParamIndex !== -1) {
			code = code.substring(0, nextParamIndex);
		}
		client.global.set("code", code);
	} else {
		throw "Response does not contain valid location."
	}
%}

### Authorization Code Flow with PKCE: step 7: Authorization Code + Code Verifier.

# @no-redirect
POST {{authUrl}}/oauth2/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&code={{code}}&redirect_uri=http://localhost/cli&client_id=authorization-pkce-client&code_verifier={{verifier}}

> {%
	client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 1. Brak tokenu -> 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/artists

### 2. Rejestracja nowego użytkownika (niezabezpieczona) -> 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bob",
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "password": "bobpassword"
}

### 3. Zalogowany użytkownik (kevin) pobiera kategorie -> 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/artists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Zwykły użytkownik (kevin) próbuje dodać kategorię -> 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/artists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pink Floyd",
  "formationYear": 1965,
  "isActive": false
}

### 5. Zwykły użytkownik (kevin) pobiera płyty artysty -> 200 OK (tylko płyty kevina)
GET {{baseUrl}}/artists/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/vinyls
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Zwykły użytkownik (kevin) dodaje nową płytę (właściciel ustawiony automatycznie) -> 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/artists/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/vinyls
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bleach",
  "releaseDate": "1989-06-15",
  "price": 119.99,
  "condition": "GOOD"
}

### 7. Próba usunięcia cudzej płyty (np. należącej do alice) jako kevin -> 403 Forbidden
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/artists/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/vinyls/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}